menu "Aaron's Drink Butler"

    config ADB_HWTEST
        bool "Build the hardware test app instead of the drink app"
        default n
        help
            The phase-1b bring-up screen (colour bars, touch crosses, backlight, beep,
            sleep). Build it with sdkconfig.hwtest, see firmware/README.md.

    config ADB_DEBUG_CONSOLE
        bool "Serial debug console (tap, open, screenshot, stats)"
        depends on !ADB_HWTEST
        default y
        help
            Reads line commands from the USB serial port so the UI can be driven and
            captured from a computer (tools/device/adb_console.py). Type "help" in
            idf.py monitor for the list.

endmenu
